error: rsjs boundary: `rsjs::server_only(...)` cannot call browser helper `rsjs::window::inner_width`

       Why:
         Browser helpers are client IR reads or effects. Opaque server-only boundaries render once on the server and are not revisited during hydration.

       Use one of:
         - Move the browser helper into a normal reactive slot, handler, binding, or client helper.
         - If the value should be static HTML, compute it from server data instead of browser state.
         - Keep `rsjs::server_only(...)` and `rsjs::server_attr(...)` limited to plain server-rendered content.

       Tracked feature:
         server_boundary.browser_helper
